<title>USA: St. Paul ISD, Minn., $16.100 mln won by I.J. Lane.</title>
<headline>St. Paul ISD, Minn., $16.100 mln won by I.J. Lane.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate J. Lane Corp. said it won $16.100 million of Saint Paul ISD 625, Minn., full faith and credit certificates of participation, Seris 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 5.13 percent.</p>
</text>
